  m_Name: memory_1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CozyFishing.Story.CutsceneDef
  id: memory_1
  titleEN: "Memory I \u2014 The Golden Hook"
  titleID: "Kenangan I \u2014 Kail Emas"
  memory: 1
  music: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3da5ac83c4bd77f4e80e1484990b8e80, type: 3}
  slides:
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3c853b0771d7cf242b9e6224519e722e, type: 3}
    textEN: You were six. You wanted the golden carp so badly that you cried when
      it would not bite.
    textID: Kamu baru enam tahun. Kamu ingin sekali ikan mas emas itu sampai menangis
      saat ia tak mau makan umpan.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c84c016f577a2a24cbbf62770bc3df77, type: 3}
    voiceID: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c084a77ea29075e478ad84fa366c15ef, type: 3}
    voiceM: {fileID: 0}
    voiceMID: {fileID: 0}
    seconds: 5.5
    zoomFrom: 1.04
    zoomTo: 1.14
    panFrom: {x: 0, y: 0}
    panTo: {x: 0.02, y: -0.02}
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 98f6195e13bf65a4b86cf9f1d601a336, type: 3}
    textEN: 'I told you: patience is the real bait. We tied the hook together, knot
      by knot.'
    textID: 'Kukatakan padamu: kesabaran adalah umpan yang sebenarnya. Kita mengikat
      kail bersama, simpul demi simpul.'
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: de95bc6dd1c0a3241b012bc1ffa67387, type: 3}
    voiceID: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7fe1edbec2145944d8a1b1037986d189, type: 3}
    voiceM: {fileID: 0}
    voiceMID: {fileID: 0}
    seconds: 5.5
    zoomFrom: 1.04
    zoomTo: 1.14
    panFrom: {x: -0.02, y: 0.01}
    panTo: {x: 0.02, y: 0}
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 828c7c4588b3c314f8e7f4383e9c6af4, type: 3}
    textEN: And when the sun stood high, she rose for us. You never forgot that light.
      Neither did I.
    textID: Dan saat matahari tepat di atas, ia muncul untuk kita. Kamu tak pernah
      melupakan cahaya itu. Aku juga tidak.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 03bd7d9cda9f8224bb4005f978e5dc35, type: 3}
    voiceID: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a52e92f0d20a36c4b950b8edb9d7cb17, type: 3}
    voiceM: {fileID: 0}
    voiceMID: {fileID: 0}
    seconds: 5.5
    zoomFrom: 1.04
    zoomTo: 1.14
    panFrom: {x: 0.02, y: -0.01}
    panTo: {x: -0.01, y: 0.02}
